*Para listar tareas
 URL: http://localhost:8081/swagger-ui/index.html#/tarea-controller/listar

********************************************************************

*Para eliminar tarea
 URL: http://localhost:8081/swagger-ui/index.html#/tarea-controller/eliminar
 (pasar {id} el numero 2)

********************************************************************

*Para poder modificar una tarea
 URL: http://localhost:8081/swagger-ui/index.html#/tarea-controller/actualizar
 (pasar {id} el numero 5)
# Request
{
  "titulo": "Prueba 10",
  "descripcion": "Prueba 10",
  "estadoId": 3
}

********************************************************************

*Para obtener una tarea en particular
 URL: http://localhost:8081/swagger-ui/index.html#/tarea-controller/obtener
 (pasar {id} el numero 5)


